 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following information to answer questions 1 - 5.</p>\n  <blockquote>\nThe temperature was recorded at several times during the day. Function <span data-math=\"T\">T</span> gives the temperature in degrees Fahrenheit, <span data-math=\"n\">n</span> hours since midnight. A graph for this function is provided.  </blockquote>\n  <p><img alt=\"A scatter plot illustrates the daily temperature fluctuation in F° over 24 hours, starting at midnight. Temperature drops in the early morning, peaks in the late afternoon, and then decreases, showing a typical diurnal cycle.\" height=\"278\" src=\"exercises/media/d805f4e258f834db.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>",
